    "detailed_description": "Adonis is a stylized, whimsical open world action game that focuses on fantasy combat! Get ready for an intense adventure in the open world of Candala!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785830/extras/0c92bf3bb26413bdf89e1563682d81f0.poster.avif?t=1692813547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785830/extras/0c92bf3bb26413bdf89e1563682d81f0.webm?t=1692813547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785830/extras/0c92bf3bb26413bdf89e1563682d81f0.mp4?t=1692813547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Massive, functional &amp; stylized (medieval &amp; post-medieval) environments</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Open world setting that features Everhaven Castle, The Ruins of Candala (Castle Ruins), and the Everhaven Caves</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Check your ranking monthly on our official website (link from main menu)</li></ul><br><br><br>Developed &amp; Published by Lorenzo Entertainment<br><br>Lead Game Designer: Michael L. Fiorentino Gutierrez<br>Lead Programmer: Samuel Hall<br>Assistant Director of Server Operations: David Conta<br>Head of Community: Carlos Velez<br>HR Director: Emily Andrews<br>Head Online Gameplay Administrator: Alex Bay<br>Creative Consultant: Cameron Rogers<br><br>* NOTE: The initial November 13, 2020 Early Access retail release of 'Adonis' does not currently support RTX &amp; DLSS features. Full RTX &amp; DLSS implementation will be released on February 26, 2021. The Steam retail price for 'Adonis' will not be raised after RTX/DLSS implementation and the retail price will not be raised after full Steam release (October 1, 2021).",
